<title>UK: Nordbanken sets $100 mln perpetual callable FRN.</title>
<headline>Nordbanken sets $100 mln perpetual callable FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following callable, step-up, subordinated floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Chase Manhattan International Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDBANKEN</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	SPREAD    *60 BP     MATURITY  **PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    25.OCT.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A3	  ISS PRICE  99.73     FULL FEES   50 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   BBB+	REOFFER    =</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR THE FIRST FIVE YEARS</p>
<p>		**CALLABLE EVERY FIVE YEARS, IF NOT CALLED, COUPON</p>
<p>		WILL BE RESET AT 3ML +210BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    25 BP     SELL CONC  25 BP     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
